}

(3) Replace this block — .approval-actions at src/web/styles.css:394-407, through the closing brace of .approval-actions input — with the new text in its place. flex-wrap: wrap goes after align-items: center; min-width: 0 goes first inside the input rule, above flex: 1:

--- OLD
.approval-actions {
  display: flex;
  gap: var(--space-2);
  align-items: center;
}

.approval-actions input {
  flex: 1;
  min-height: 44px;
  padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-2);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-muted);
  border-radius: var(--radius-1);
